        "title": "1. ANATOMY &amp; ANOMALIES",
        "content": "• <b>Lens:</b> Avascular, grows throughout life! Power = 17D. <b>A-scan biometry</b> measures axial length for IOL.<br>\n      • <b>Coloboma:</b> Equator notching + iris coloboma/giant tear.<br>\n      • <b>Lenticonus:</b> Ant = <b>Alport</b>; Post = <b>Lowe</b>.<br>\n      • <b>Microspherophakia:</b> <b>Weill-Marchesani</b>.<br>\n      • <b>Subluxation:</b> Marfan, Homocystinuria, Weill-Marchesani (🚫 <i>NOT Laurence-Moon-Biedl!</i>)."
