        "title": "3. EYELIDS (75-Q FILE)",
        "content": "• <b>Anatomy:</b> Covers <b>1/6</b> cornea; <b>Gray line</b> splits lamellae. LPS = CN III; Orbicularis = CN VII.<br>\n      • <b>Blepharitis:</b> 25% baby shampoo. Ulcerative = bleeding ulcers $\\rightarrow$ Madarosis, Poliosis, Tylosis.<br>\n      • <b>Chalazion:</b> Painless Meibomian lipogranuloma (epithelioid/giant cells) $\\rightarrow$ Hot compress / Vertical incision. (<i>Recurrent in elderly = <b>Meibomian gland carcinoma</b>!</i>).<br>\n      • <b>Ptosis:</b> #1 Congenital = <b>Myogenic</b>. Check <b>Levator function</b>! Severe = <b>Fascia lata sling</b>."
